&_nc_oc=AdoQpgag8tub3JlgHzzcrhoqh50ZNXf4XurY4fJJH_2jWvyZR-igJI7ipFXn0zjYDzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9bxJO-1cLJ5WUtBgMyT7kC1c4eafgK02LfINZOi8m4TQ&oe=6A2196BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ujbU78UaPRsQ7kNvwEoL5S5&_nc_oc=AdqcljPUX_nepZO4eI-9ncxNVPDF_nJGaVCYgomBrS-fQRJghVF8qaNrBikuBcfyBU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-rKJEcqdQ_tenR0EHaecw4cs2Gvp_975CdIbQLAtr69g&oe=6A21A7BC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hhBhAsVqGlwQ7kNvwH_AD2y&_nc_oc=AdqW-3XXtKT5qlCd6pxZ_9nhlnMKgFgjUG8_QzBHcrJ0bOVr6sVnc97uDydCB-lJURg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8zqLxx6Lx6zNugx6wMjT1OwQAKkNBRh75z9MzuYPm19g&oe=6A218E07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RR8f99ljBk0Q7kNvwHQeYWR&_nc_oc=Adpsm7ZwRp7t3eLY91gR-OAPD8RGbuQDKmfMtHAJ--sKzSB8OSb2MpIx75x1FRNlRB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8bR3-zyJsYJmInJ0xetMWlsI7shR9SGYsA30pnrXm93A&oe=6A2179D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UoQqagPRaooQ7kNvwEtGZz6&_nc_oc=Ado5Ikwxv7CN1e2D3WrneQmuEwO3dwYYXb0SbMRKUDsrxJ1lLPsar-EgotoQEkNOYXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9GxPs8Oj1zfUQiUCAfWGYJG2nZftWmPCQ_Qh-aJGSvzA&oe=6A218664"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.